    59|/**
    60| * Derive a stable document key from a store's absolute file path. We key on the
    61| * path AFTER `logs/audit/` so the key is stable across machines and roots, e.g.
    62| * `/app/data/logs/audit/lead-capture/leads.json` → `lead-capture/leads.json`.
